infra
docs
.playwright-mcp
# apps/scraper is NOT excluded wholesale any more: apps/backend/Dockerfile ships
# `python -m scraper media` into the image as an on-demand tool. Excluding the
# directory made the build fail on its COPY — and only at deploy time, since CI
# never builds this image.
#
# The parts that must stay out are the ones that are big, machine-local or
# irrelevant to the CLI. .venv alone is 524 MB.
apps/scraper/.venv
apps/scraper/tests
apps/scraper/scripts
apps/scraper/conftest.py
# Local incremental-sync state. Baking one machine's cache into the image would
# make the container think products it has never seen are already up to date.
apps/scraper/state.db
**/__pycache__
apps/capri-storefront
